    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1922c904_a447c808",
        "filename": "tests/hostside/java/com/android/microdroid/test/MicrodroidHostTests.java",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 442,
      "author": {
        "id": 1897307
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-25T18:37:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure if I understand your question.\n\n1) If it is about how `MicrodroidTestApp` \u0026 `MicrodroidTestAppUpdated` are essentially same.\n\nThat is possible because they have same package name \u0026 same signer (Key used to sign them), use same dependencies etc.\n\nI think in Android, the hash of certificate is also considered?\n\n\n2) If it is about how Microdroid knows if the package is same or updated.\n\nIt is due to Secretkeeper/DICE policies. Relevant information about the apk is extracted by Microdroid Manger (using libapkmanifest [a]). MM then constructs that DICE policies allowing access to secrets only if the apk versions have gone up \u0026 Authority is the same(ie, same signer of the apk). The DICE policies are stored in a persistent storage (Secretkeeper)\n\n[a] https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/libs/apkmanifest/\n[b] https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/microdroid_manager/src/vm_secret.rs;l\u003d161-175?q\u003dvm_secret\n\n\n\u003e  if \u0027a foreign app with the same package name + higher version\u0027 is installed before the intended update?\n\nIf the foreign app is signed with a different policy, then DICE policy checks will fail \u0026 VM will fail to boot.\n\nPlease let me know if that doesnt answer your question.",
      "parentUuid": "ba57353e_1ab16622",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 440,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 442,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "b8de2c0a582909ece060694a3ad94851a9dd6bc4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
